'''Nektropos Undercroft''' is a city in EverQuest Legends.

Add a brief description of the city, its residents, alignment, important services, and place in the world.
Nektropos Undercroft is a very small, compact hovel situated underneath Nektropos Castle. Very much like New Sebilis, it contains a concentrated set of NPCs for tradeskills and training as well as a banker. Just outside in the courtyard of the castle, within Lake Nerius Zone, is a classic high-spawn rate newbie area with low level monsters.
As of this writing, you are not able to start a new character as Aer`Haeth, but at some eventual future in which you can, this fits in with other similar starting zones.

