== Traveling To and From ==

The Undercroft is accessed by a cellar door in along the South wall of the castle in Lake Nerius.  This door is located within a newbie yard that is walled off by mountainous terrain, which in turn is accessed by a short tunnel through the hills.

Tunnel entrance: 1620, -930, 0

Cellar door: 2435, -1155, -10

